# 统一行尾：CI 配置与脚本一律 LF（GitHub Actions 的 YAML 块标量对 CRLF 敏感）
* text=auto
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
# 二进制
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
